  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b126">
    <ns4:nomeIta>Funzioni del temperamento e della personalitÃ </ns4:nomeIta>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Traumatic_Brain_Injury"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Spinal_Cord_Injury"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Body_functions"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Hearing_Loss"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Low_Back_Pain"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Vocational_Rehabilitation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Stroke"/>
    <ns4:descrizioneITA>Funzioni mentali generali del temperamento proprio dellâ€™individuo che lo portano a reagire in un particolare modo alle situazioni, inclusa la serie di caratteristiche mentali che rende un individuo distinto dagli altri.

Inclusioni: funzioni di estroversione, introversione, giovialitÃ , coscienziositÃ , stabilitÃ  emotiva e psichica e apertura alle esperienze; ottimismo; ricerca delle novitÃ ; fiducia; affidabilitÃ 

Esclusioni: funzioni intellettive (b117); funzioni dellâ€™energia e
delle pulsioni (b130); funzioni psicomotorie (b147); funzioni
emozionali (b152)</ns4:descrizioneITA>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b126"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <ns4:description>General mental functions of constitutional disposition of the individual to react in a particular way to situations, including the set of mental characteristics that makes the individual distinct from others.
Inclusions: functions of extraversion, introversion, agreeableness, conscientiousness, psychic and emotional stability, and openness to experience; optimism; novelty seeking; confidence; trustworthiness
Exclusions: intellectual functions (b117); energy and drive functions (b130); psychomotor functions (b147); emotional functions (b152)</ns4:description>
    <rdfs:label>Temperament and personality functions</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
