    <ns4:description>Functions of involuntary contraction of muscles automatically induced by specific stimuli.
Inclusions: functions of stretch motor reflex, automatic local joint reflex, reflexes generated by noxious stimuli and other exteroceptive stimuli; withdrawal reflex, biceps reflex, radius reflex, quadriceps reflex, patellar reflex, ankle reflex, emergence and persistence of reflexes</ns4:description>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Spinal_Cord_Injury"/>
