  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b235">
    <ns4:descrizioneITA>Funzioni sensoriali dellâ€™orecchio interno correlate alla posizione, allâ€™equilibrio e al movimento.

Inclusioni: funzioni della posizione e del senso di posizione; funzioni dellâ€™equilibrio del corpo e del movimento

Esclusione: sensazioni associate alla funzione uditiva e vestibolare (b240)</ns4:descrizioneITA>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b235"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdfs:label>Vestibular functions</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Body_functions"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Hearing_Loss"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Traumatic_Brain_Injury"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Vocational_Rehabilitation"/>
    <ns4:nomeIta>Funzioni vestibolari</ns4:nomeIta>
    <ns4:description>Sensory functions of the inner ear related to position, balance and movement.
Inclusions: functions of position and positional sense; functions of balance of the body and movement
Exclusions: sensation associated with hearing and vestibular functions (b240)</ns4:description>
  </rdf:Description>
