    <ns8:Net_job_titles>Sample of reported job titles: Claims Clerk, Clerk, Documentation Specialist, File Clerk, Human Resources Assistant (HR Assistant), Manufacturing Clerk, Medical Records Clerk, Office Assistant, Police Records Clerk, Records Clerk</ns8:Net_job_titles>
