    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/SkAb#Cognitive_Abilities"/>
    <ns7:Net_definition>The ability to come up with a number of ideas about a topic (the number of ideas is important, not their quality, correctness, or creativity).</ns7:Net_definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b176">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b176"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Body_functions"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Stroke"/>
    <ns4:descrizioneITA>Funzioni mentali specifiche del mettere in sequenza e coordinare movimenti complessi e finalizzati.

Inclusioni: menomazioni come nellâ€™aprassia ideatoria, ideomotoria, del vestirsi, oculomotoria e verbale

Esclusioni: funzioni psicomotorie (b147); funzioni cognitive di livello superiore (b164); Capitolo 7 â€“ Funzioni neuro-muscoloscheletriche e correlate al movimento</ns4:descrizioneITA>
    <ns4:description>Specific mental functions of sequencing and co-ordinating complex, purposeful movements.
Inclusions: impairements such as in ideation, ideomotor, dressing, oculomotor, speech apraxia
Exclusions: psychomotor functions (b147); higher-level cognitive functions (b164); Chapter 7 Neuromusculoskeletal and Movement Related Functions (b7)</ns4:description>
    <ns4:nomeIta>Funzione mentale di sequenza dei movimenti complessi</ns4:nomeIta>
    <rdfs:label>Mental functions of sequencing complex movements</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d4503">
