  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d420">
    <ns4:description xml:lang="en">Moving from one surface to another, such as sliding along a bench or moving from a bed to a chair, without changing body position.

Inclusions: transferring oneself while sitting or lying

Exclusions: changing basic body position (d410)</ns4:description>
